- **Standing lines:** PRIOR-WORK CHECK (above); no message to any human; Jira writes only where the property says; never delete (quarantine); never print a credential; no word added to any user-facing text; `always-verify-and-check` and `no-skip-on-failure`: a red you cannot explain is a STOP.
- **HOLDS:** no deploy and no statement about the hosted state beyond "NOT DEPLOYED" as a repository fact; no ruling of your own (the ruling is quoted; the override has none); no label edit on any existing issue; no edit of `package.json` or the lock, no update lane for the 15 open alerts (the row is the record of them); the registry is not read by you.

